## ⚙️ Configuration

Edit these variables at the top of `rty_ichimoku.py`:

```python
DB_PATH              = "rty_ichimoku.db"    # SQLite database location
TICKER               = "RTY=F"              # Yahoo Finance ticker
TIMEZONE             = "America/New_York"   # Your timezone
MIN_SIGNAL_STRENGTH  = 4                    # Min conditions to alert (4 or 5)
```

