## ⚠️ Important Notes

- RTY futures trade nearly 24/5 — signals can appear outside market hours
- URTY/SRTY are **3x leveraged ETFs** — only trade in direction of strong cloud signals
- **Never hold leveraged ETFs more than 3-5 days** due to daily decay
- Signal levels are on **RTY points** — URTY/SRTY will move ~3x those percentages
- This is a tool for education and analysis — NOT financial advice

